        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-70, Small 1-3/8 Inch Acrylic Radiance Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small 1-3/8 Inch Acrylic Radiance Cabinet Knob is available with satin nickel, polished nickel, and satin brass mounts. It has a transitional feel that makes it perfect for a wide array of interior home decors. This Clear Acrylic Radiance Knob  has a contemporary design that manages to walk the balance between being cold and sterile looking and being too old-fashioned in design. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/site/product.cfm?id=\"><b>Large Radiance Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/radiance-clear-acrylic-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-470\"><b>Radiance Cabinet Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/12-inch-radiance-acrylic-appliance-pull-rk-international-ph-7000\"><b>12 Inch Radiance Appliance Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/18-inch-radiance-acrylic-appliance-pull-rk-international-ph-7001\"><b>18 Inch Radiance Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Radiance Cabinet Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
